{
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "kind": "standard",
  "organization": "ScaleDock",
  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Covers AG-UI, the Agent-User Interaction Protocol, in three version lines: AG-UI 1.0 (current, specification 1.0 with its JSON Schema, cross-checked against repository commit e60019d and @ag-ui/core 1.0.0), the legacy 0.x line with the upgrade to 1.0, and the AG-UI 1.1 working draft as a preview (posture: track). SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow for producers, consumers and middleware; references cover versions and upgrades, the event model and its eight families, the HTTP + SSE and HTTP + Protobuf bindings, frontend tools and interrupts for human-in-the-loop, and the processing model, version negotiation and SDKs.",
